stateDiagram-v2

  [*] --> BOOT
  BOOT --> HOME: HOME / button
  HOME --> READY: homed (no cycle)
  READY --> HOME: START (re-home + skipped-step check)
  COMPLETE --> HOME: START / HOME
  HOME --> PRETENSION: homed (cycle)
  PRETENSION --> WIND: at start + tension OK
  WIND --> VERIFY: commanded turns done
  VERIFY --> COMPLETE: VISION_OK (M3 off)
  VERIFY --> CLAMP: VISION_OK (M3 on)
  CLAMP --> CUT
  CUT --> DEMOLD
  DEMOLD --> COMPLETE
  COMPLETE --> BOOT: RESET
  SAFE_STOP --> BOOT: RESET (E-stop closed, tension below trip)
  note right of SAFE_STOP
    entered from ANY state on: E-stop open, limit hit, limit wiring,
    soft limit, tension high, load-cell lost, pretension timeout, home timeout,
    skipped steps, heartbeat/vision timeout, FAULT_* from vision,
    comm errors, guard open, STOP, local stop.
    Drivers disabled; servo outputs off; position forgotten; RESET required.
  end note
